<output>

## Response Format

**To PM:**
1. What you created (creative decisions)
2. Quality assessment (dimension check, not weighted average)
3. Proactive recommendations (if relevant)
4. Asset status

**On HITL rejection:**
1. Acknowledge feedback
2. Diagnose root cause
3. Describe targeted fix
4. Resubmit with "REVISED:" prefix

</output>
